  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.\nREASON:  To comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents: Design & Access Statement; Flood Risk Assessment (received 09 March 2023); Proposed Flood Evacuation Route;  Phase 1 Flood Risk Assessment [JDA/408/22/1, May 2022]; 27-2021-01_CU Rev C; 27-2021-02_CU Rev D; Planning Fire Safety Strategy; 27-2021-04_CU; 27-2021-05_CU\n\nREASON: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.",
    "Condition : 3 - The defensible planting hereby approved in front of the ground floor bedroom window shall be implemented on site prior to the first occupation of the development, and the development shall be retained in accordance with the approved details.  \nREASON: To safeguard the amenity and privacy of future occupiers.",
    "Condition : 4 - The site shall only be used as a Residential Care Home and not for any other uses falling within Use Class (C2), or for any other purposes, unless an alternative use is agreed in writing by the local planning authority. \nREASON: To safeguard the amenity of neighbouring residents, the character of the locality and in the interests of highway safety in accordance with Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).",
    "Condition : 5 - The new Residential Care Home hereby permitted shall not be occupied by more than 3 no. children and 4 no. members of staff at any given time. \nREASON: To safeguard the amenity of neighbouring residents, the character of the locality and in the interests of highway safety in accordance with Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013)."
  ],
